'''Hevijak the Wicked''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]]. He can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] improves health, attack, and range, with 100% chance to [[Knockback]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

