==Trivia==
*Hevijak's name is most likely derived from 蛇 ''hebi'' (snake), ''evil''/''devil'' and 邪悪 ''jāku'' (wicked), in which case it essentially means "evil snake". It may also play off of how 蛇 and 邪 can both be read as ''ja''.
*Hevijak is the first and only [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] to be able to be utilized in a stage even if you do not own him, thanks to [[Catclaw Championships]]' Fixed Lineups.

